<title>UK: NatWest rates under review after BoE hike.</title>
<headline>NatWest rates under review after BoE hike.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Westminster Bank said on Wednesday its rates were under review after the Bank of England raised official UK interest rates by a quarter point to six percent.  </p>
<p>&quot;Our rates are under a review,&quot; said a spokesman.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
